  m_Name: SayoriAsksMCAwkwardQuestionsAndGetsAttackedByADragon
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351879
    - rid: 8164893192264351880
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As the pair are making their way west, Sayori's been trying to talk to
      {mc}-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351881
    - rid: 8164893192264351883
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}... hello...?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351884
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Which he's been dutifully ignoring. Instead, he's choosing to focus on
      reading the pages of transcriptions that Natsuki gave him.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351885
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: This stone commemorates the child king Jahfnar who was burned alive by
      the <SineText=3>fire</SineText> of great dragon Lodunost.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351886
    - rid: 8164893192264351887
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (If I remember right, this one should be from Dustman's Cairn...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351888
    - rid: 8164893192264351904
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} looks at the next page, unintentionally ignoring Sayori as he focuses
      on increasing his vocabulary.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351889
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: This stone commemorates the horse Savirra, the most courageous <SineText=3>animal</SineText>
      ever to charge the snowy battlefields, and give his life for his lord.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Dang, a whole word wall just for some horse? Cute.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351890
    - rid: 8164893192264351891
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}! Finally, you looked up-!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351905
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori's joy is short-lived, as {mc}'s eyes go back down to the third
      and final page Natsuki gave him.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351892
    - rid: 8164893192264351893
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Here fell Hrothmar, <SineText=3>Wrath</SineText> Wolf, from the savage
      plains; may his soul wander Sovngarde forever.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Huh. I can't remember which dungeon this is from, or which shout this
      goes with...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (I could probably ask the Graybeards about it if I find the time-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351894
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>{mc}</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351895
    - rid: 8164893192264351896
    - rid: 8164893192264351897
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What? What's going on?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351898
    - rid: 8164893192264351899
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You've been ignoring me ever since we left Whiterun! I've been trying
      to talk to you!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351900
    - rid: 8164893192264351901
    - rid: 8164893192264351906
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I have?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351902
    - rid: 8164893192264351903
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh. Sorry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351907
    - rid: 8164893192264351908
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I just thought it'd be important to read over the transcriptions Natsuki
      gave me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320448
    - rid: 8164893214562320449
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: They wouldn't do me any good just sitting around in my pockets, so I
      might as well get what I can out of them as soon as possible.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320450
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll forgive you-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351913
    - rid: 8164893192264351914
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>If</i> you pay attention to me now!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351915
    - rid: 8164893192264351916
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure, what's up, Sayori?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351917
    - rid: 8164893192264351918
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351919
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Um, I wanted to talk about yesterday, {mc}...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351920
    - rid: 8164893192264351921
    - rid: 8164893192264351922
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... What <i>about</i> yesterday?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351923
    - rid: 8164893192264351924
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, well, um...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351925
    - rid: 8164893192264351926
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You, uh, never answered my confession...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351929
    - rid: 8164893192264351930
    - rid: 8164893192264351931
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ohh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351932
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Heh. Yeah, I guess that was pretty obviously a confession...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893192264351933
    - rid: 8164893192264351934
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320384
    - rid: 8164893214562320385
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What's that supposed to mean? What'd you think that was?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320386
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I, uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320387
    - rid: 8164893214562320388
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Would you believe me if I said I didn't really <i>think</i> about it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320389
    - rid: 8164893214562320390
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... so, you're trying to say you didn't remember-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320391
    - rid: 8164893214562320392
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No, that's not what I-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320393
    - rid: 8164893214562320394
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Look:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320451
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If you recall, all throughout your confession I was telling you why I
      think you didn't actually love me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320452
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And even now, I still think you don't.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320453
    - rid: 8164893214562320454
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: B-but I do...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320455
    - rid: 8164893214562320456
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... haaaahh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320457
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, even if that were true, you really shouldn't get romantically invested
      in someone who's suicidal.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320458
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You still want to kill yourself...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320459
    - rid: 8164893214562320460
    - rid: 8164893214562320461
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320462
    - rid: 8164893214562320463
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not sure if want is the right word.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320464
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess it'd be more accurate to say that if I dropped dead right now,
      I'd be as fine with that as being alive.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because that's just where I'm at, I suppose.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320465
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Not to imply that I'd go let myself get shivved by some Forsworn, I've
      still gotta keep you safe and help out Natsuki-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320466
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But still, even if part of me can rationally understand and want to keep
      kicking to help take down the entity...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320467
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I just can't <i>feel</i> it. If that makes any sense.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320468
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Which, I guess is the reason why I didn''t really internalize your confession:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320469
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Rationally, I could understand what you were telling me, but I just couldn't
      <i>feel</i> it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320470
    - rid: 8164893214562320478
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320471
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That's so sad...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320472
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You've got all this trouble inside and you're apologizing to me...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320473
    - rid: 8164893214562320474
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: No, I'm sorry for springing how I feel on you, I should've known better-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320475
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's okay, Sayori. I'm pretty sure it's natural to tell someone you like
      that you love them.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320476
    - rid: 8164893214562320479
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, I really should've seen it coming.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320480
    - rid: 8164893214562320481
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320484
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, I suspected you might've had a thing for me since before we were
      sent to Skyrim.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320485
    - rid: 8164893214562320490
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Then why didn't you say anything, you meanie!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320486
    - rid: 8164893214562320489
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you seriously forget how hectic that week became toward the end?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320487
    - rid: 8164893214562320488
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Between festival prep, worrying about Natsuki's home life-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320492
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika's panic attacks, which in retrospect were probably due to the
      entity's interference-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320491
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri's potential addiction, which we now know is <i>really</i> bad-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320493
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And how you apparently had bi-polar disorder this whole time, <i>and</i>
      a harmful, skewed sense of responsibility.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320494
    - rid: 8164893214562320495
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'I literally remember thinking:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320496
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: '"Man, I really shouldn''t get myself romantically entangled with anybody,
      especially if they''ve got something crazy going on!"'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320497
    - rid: 8164893214562320500
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaahh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320498
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Guess I'm one of the "something-crazy-going-ons" now, huh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320499
    - rid: 8164893214562320501
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Maybe it''d be better to have someone <i>really</i> close you could
      talk to about stuff like that, instead of going at it alone...? '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320502
    - rid: 8164893214562320503
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori, I'm not dumb, I can see what you're doing there.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320504
    - rid: 8164893214562320505
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Romantic relationships are inherently a two-way street: I''d have to
      be <i>able</i> to reciprocate if it''d be any good for the both of us.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320506
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And I'm not sure if I could, even if I wanted to.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320507
    - rid: 8164893214562320508
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, we're having this conversation right now, aren't we? Even though
      we're not dating?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320509
    - rid: 8164893214562320510
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, in that sense, you've already got what you want.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320511
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Mmm...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320512
    - rid: 8164893214562320513
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, maybe we could-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320514
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori's proposition is interrupted by the sounds of a dragon's thu'um,
      seemingly approaching the two.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320515
    - rid: 8164893214562320516
    - rid: 8164893214562320517
    - rid: 8164893214562320518
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (<NoiseText=1,1>Alright, asshole, which mountain are you gonna fly over</NoiseText>...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320519
    - rid: 8164893214562320528
    - rid: 8164893214562320529
    - rid: 8164893214562320530
    - rid: 8164893214562320531
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, there''s a dragon over there-!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320520
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori points in the direction of the dragon, showing {mc} his target.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320521
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The dragon attempts to do diving run, breathing fire at them both, but-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320522
    - rid: 8164893214562320523
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>J8R Z4 FRUL</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320524
    - rid: 8164893214562320525
    - rid: 8164893214562320526
    - rid: 8164893214562320527
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}''s shout collides with the dragon, causing it to fall from the
