    - rid: 8164893214562320566
    - rid: 8164893214562320567
    - rid: 8164893214562320568
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Stick behind me, Sayo-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320569
    - rid: 8164893214562320570
    - rid: 8164893214562320571
    - rid: 8164893214562320572
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (And <b>you</b>. <b>You</b> keep her safe, too.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320573
    - rid: 8164893214562320574
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320575
    - rid: 8164893214562320576
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Phew... over-glorified lizard down.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320587
    - rid: 8164893214562320591
    - rid: 8164893214562320589
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The dragon bursts into flames, and its soul flies into {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320579
    - rid: 8164893214562320580
    - rid: 8164893214562320581
    - rid: 8164893214562320590
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Now, let's see if I can't use the extra power from that soul to try
      and wrap my head around the fire breath shout...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320582
    - rid: 8164893214562320583
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, wasn''t there a bunch of gold in the last dragon we fought?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320592
    - rid: 8164893214562320593
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, you're right. Let's get the gold, then get back on the road.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320594
    - rid: 8164893214562320595
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The two grab all 132 septims that fell out of what used to be the dragon's
      stomach.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320596
    - rid: 8164893214562320597
    - rid: 8164893214562320598
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Once the spoils of war are all accounted for, the two resume their journey
      to Lost Valley Redoubt.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320599
    - rid: 8164893214562320600
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: By the time Sayori remembers that she was having a delicate conversation
      with {mc} before the dragon attack, she had already forgotten what she was
      going to say...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893214562320601
